3. REAL-TIME AUDIO, ACOUSTIC FEEDBACK & HARDWARE SAFETY NOTICE
==============================================================================
LiveAirMic is a real-time microphone capture and low-latency audio streaming
tool capable of generating high-gain audio signals. Even when built-in
Adaptive Feedback Cancellation (AFC) and brickwall limiters are active:
  - Always start with studio monitor, PA system, and headphone levels turned
    down before arming tracks or enabling live monitoring.
  - As set forth in Sections 7 and 8 of the Apache License, Version 2.0, the
    software is provided strictly "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, and
